==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|de|Alptraum||sole standard spelling until 1996; now less common}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|de|Alb|Traum}}, because nightmares in some forms of German folklore are thought to be caused by an elf sitting on one's chest while one slept.

